Package: scr-resets-monitor
Version: 1.0.7
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SCR project <noreply@localhost>
Depends: bash (>= 4.3), coreutils, util-linux, gzip, tar
Description: Read-only BMC reset history and decision API
 Records existing SEMA observations through Bash and preserves reset history.
 Provides explicit threshold/window decisions without activating recovery policy.
